            <div class="field field--name-field-text field--type-text-long field--label-hidden field--item"><div class="bne-font-cinzel--medium" style="color:#fff;text-shadow:#000000 1px 0 10px;"><h3 style="color:#D8B47B;">A NEW FANTASY WORLD</h3><p><img alt width="1326" height="91" class="twic" typeof="foaf:Image" data-twic-src="image:/high/elden-ring/elden-ring-tarnished-edition/00-product-page/ER-Tarnished-Edition-Separator.png" data-twic-src-transform="cover/step=10/quality=80" style="object-fit: cover" loading="lazy" src="https://p325k7wa.twic.pics/high/elden-ring/elden-ring-tarnished-edition/00-product-page/ER-Tarnished-Edition-Separator.png?twic=v1/cover=300/step=10/quality=80/output=preview"></p><p class="text-align-justify">Journey through the <strong>Lands Between</strong>, a new fantasy world created by <strong>Hidetaka Miyazaki</strong>, creator of the influential DARK SOULS video game series, and George R. R. Martin, author of The New York Times best-selling fantasy series, A Song of Ice and Fire.</p><p class="text-align-justify">Unravel the mysteries of the <span style="color:#D8B47B;"><strong>Elden Ring’</strong></span>s power. Encounter adversaries with profound backgrounds, characters with their own unique motivations for helping or hindering your progress, and fearsome creatures.&nbsp;</p><p><br>&nbsp;</p><p class="text-align-center"><img alt width="60" height="60" class="twic" typeof="foaf:Image" data-twic-src="image:/high/elden-ring/elden-ring-tarnished-edition/00-product-page/ER-Tarnished-Edition-Key-Feature-ornament.png" data-twic-src-transform="cover/step=10/quality=80" style="object-fit: cover" loading="lazy" src="https://p325k7wa.twic.pics/high/elden-ring/elden-ring-tarnished-edition/00-product-page/ER-Tarnished-Edition-Key-Feature-ornament.png?twic=v1/cover=300/step=10/quality=80/output=preview"></p></div></div>
      
