            <div class="field field--name-field-text field--type-text-long field--label-hidden field--item"><div class="bne-font-cinzel--medium" style="color:#fff;text-shadow:#000000 1px 0 10px;"><h3 class="text-align-left" style="color:#D8B47B;">WORLD EXPLORATION IN THE LANDS BETWEEN</h3><p><img alt width="1326" height="91" class="twic" typeof="foaf:Image" data-twic-src="image:/high/elden-ring/elden-ring-tarnished-edition/00-product-page/ER-Tarnished-Edition-Separator.png" data-twic-src-transform="cover/step=10/quality=80" style="object-fit: cover" loading="lazy" src="https://p325k7wa.twic.pics/high/elden-ring/elden-ring-tarnished-edition/00-product-page/ER-Tarnished-Edition-Separator.png?twic=v1/cover=300/step=10/quality=80/output=preview"></p><p class="text-align-justify"><strong style="color:#D8B47B;">ELDEN RING</strong> features vast fantastical landscapes and shadowy, complex dungeons that are connected seamlessly.</p><p class="text-align-justify">Traverse the breathtaking world on foot or on horseback, alone or online with other players, and fully immerse yourself in the grassy plains, suffocating swamps, spiraling mountains, foreboding castles and other sites of grandeur on a scale never seen before in a <strong style="color:#D8B47B;">FromSoftware </strong>title.&nbsp;</p><p><br>&nbsp;</p><p class="text-align-center"><img alt width="60" height="60" class="twic" typeof="foaf:Image" data-twic-src="image:/high/elden-ring/elden-ring-tarnished-edition/00-product-page/ER-Tarnished-Edition-Key-Feature-ornament.png" data-twic-src-transform="cover/step=10/quality=80" style="object-fit: cover" loading="lazy" src="https://p325k7wa.twic.pics/high/elden-ring/elden-ring-tarnished-edition/00-product-page/ER-Tarnished-Edition-Key-Feature-ornament.png?twic=v1/cover=300/step=10/quality=80/output=preview"></p></div></div>
      
